      "good": "Roles, engineer names and phone numbers remain on one line, making each assignment easy to match. Notes have enough room to read in short phrases.",
      "problems": "Two of the three date ranges break across lines, while notes still occupy three or four lines and leave substantial empty space in the contact columns.",
